project name: receit-generator  
author-name: ntokozo maselela
email: shaunmaselela25@icloud.com

description:
A small JavaScript program that demonstrates variables and data types.
It takes a product name, unit price, quantity (received as a string, as
if from a form field) and VAT rate, converts the quantity to a number,
and prints a receipt with subtotal, tax and total in rand. It also
demonstrates what happens when a non-numeric quantity is converted 'NAN'
and how a real application should handle it.

how it run:
You need to have node.js installed

then save the file receipt-generator.js
open the terminal and run 
'node receipt-generator'